The noise reduction models in this directory, enc.onnx, erb_dec.onnx and
df_dec.onnx, are DeepFilterNet3's (48 kHz, fft 960, hop 480, 32 ERB bands,
96 deep-filtered bins, order 5, look-ahead 2), by Hendrik Schröter,
under the MIT license (DeepFilterNet is dual-licensed MIT or Apache-2.0;
taken under the MIT license), unchanged, as the DeepFilterNet project
publishes them:

    https://github.com/Rikorose/DeepFilterNet/raw/main/models/DeepFilterNet3_onnx.tar.gz
    SHA-256 c94d91f70911001c946e0fabb4aa9adc37045f45a03b56008cb0c8244cb63616

The archive's tmp/export/ holds them, with their config.ini. SHA-256:

